{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStartStopDiscontinue"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"The end of an ending with no downward jog, as is typical for second endings that do not conclude a piece.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstartstopdiscontinue\/discontinue"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStartStopDiscontinue\/discontinue","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"case","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"discontinue","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Case","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL23MXLStartStopDiscontinueO11discontinueyA2CmF","role":"symbol","title":"MXLStartStopDiscontinue.discontinue"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"discontinue","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLStartStopDiscontinue/discontinue":{"abstract":[{"text":"The end of an ending with no downward jog, as is typical for second endings that do not conclude a piece.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstartstopdiscontinue\/discontinue","title":"MXLStartStopDiscontinue.discontinue","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStartStopDiscontinue\/discontinue","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"discontinue"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLStartStopDiscontinue":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStartStopDiscontinue","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLStartStopDiscontinue","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLStartStopDiscontinue","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The start-stop-discontinue type is used to specify ending types. Typically, the start type is associated with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the left barline of the first measure in an ending. The stop and discontinue types are associated with the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"right barline of the last measure in an ending. Stop is used when the ending mark concludes with a downward"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"jog, as is typical for first endings. Discontinue is used when there is no downward jog, as is typical for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"second endings that do not conclude a piece."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstartstopdiscontinue","title":"MXLStartStopDiscontinue"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]}}}